{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Humbug Tales: Keeper of the Swarm",
    "steam_appid": 2573840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect seed currency, handy natural resources, and food for your queen.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a thriving ant colony made up of specialized castes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your ants to manipulate obstacles, form living bridges, and follow pheromone trails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish enemies by directing your bugs in swarm combat and using items strategically.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573840/extras/115e0ce4a3c6df222a9813d751ad532d.avif?t=1746544347\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey across the lily pond</strong> in pursuit of your long-lost child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you\u2019ll meet a cast of bug and \u201chumbug\u201d friends, from quirky Spider-Keepers to nomadic desert Seekers who glow in the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: the sky above is home to the insect world\u2019s fearsome matriarch, Dagmar the wasp. Beneath her hungry eye, you and your swarm will face sinister thief ants, zombie fungi, and cultish Waspling humbugs.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573840/extras/e60b2a8364bfc46e28472a20669c455d.avif?t=1746544347\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your bugs</strong> through a variety of lush wetland environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form chains of ants into bridges to cross watery chasms. Use their combined strength to manipulate the environment and discover new areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To grow your flock, you must feed your Queen! Draw pheromone trails to new food sources, and expand your colony with industrious workers, powerful soldiers, winged alates, and heavyweight repletes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573840/extras/5f35d2afbcd3ad907673d55d3987ea57.avif?t=1746544347\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rally the swarm</strong> and take on the megafauna of the insect kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat fierce predators and enemy humbugs, you\u2019ll need wits, courage\u2014and spidersilk weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you and your six-legged friends just might succeed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect seed currency, handy natural resources, and food for your queen.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a thriving ant colony made up of specialized castes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your ants to manipulate obstacles, form living bridges, and follow pheromone trails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish enemies by directing your bugs in swarm combat and using items strategically.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573840/extras/115e0ce4a3c6df222a9813d751ad532d.avif?t=1746544347\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey across the lily pond</strong> in pursuit of your long-lost child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you\u2019ll meet a cast of bug and \u201chumbug\u201d friends, from quirky Spider-Keepers to nomadic desert Seekers who glow in the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: the sky above is home to the insect world\u2019s fearsome matriarch, Dagmar the wasp. Beneath her hungry eye, you and your swarm will face sinister thief ants, zombie fungi, and cultish Waspling humbugs.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573840/extras/e60b2a8364bfc46e28472a20669c455d.avif?t=1746544347\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your bugs</strong> through a variety of lush wetland environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form chains of ants into bridges to cross watery chasms. Use their combined strength to manipulate the environment and discover new areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To grow your flock, you must feed your Queen! Draw pheromone trails to new food sources, and expand your colony with industrious workers, powerful soldiers, winged alates, and heavyweight repletes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573840/extras/5f35d2afbcd3ad907673d55d3987ea57.avif?t=1746544347\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rally the swarm</strong> and take on the megafauna of the insect kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat fierce predators and enemy humbugs, you\u2019ll need wits, courage\u2014and spidersilk weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you and your six-legged friends just might succeed.</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience life as a humbug (humanoid bug) and raise a loyal flock of ants. Explore a world of wetland wonders and tiny bug friends. Conquer puzzles, pirates, and predators\u2014for the swarm!",
